    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witch's Apocalyptic Journey is a cooperative multiplayer card Roguelite game with role-playing elements. Form a Witch Squad with your buddies and come destroy the world to the ground~!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.poster.avif?t=1754287304\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.webm?t=1754287304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.mp4?t=1754287304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0As symbols of the ominous, the Witches are veritable stars of calamity, and in Aldrin, their presence means only one thing: the world is coming to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0 They are both executioners and morticians, leading the footsteps of the Witches as they give the world its last ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join your friends in the guise of a witch, or recruit a squad of NPCs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/811fd1ddd7c36bc055d1834d188c5aed.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Players can form a team of up to four witches to experience the fun of strategy cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You can also recruit other NPCs to replenish your strength during the events. Death is not the end of the road, and you can return to the battlefield with a mouthful of milk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your own magic and customize your cards with a high degree of freedom!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/8d8b1ca42bebf3b1326d2fccdc4d94e7.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0In addition to the cards you may obtain in the game, you will have the opportunity to obtain \u201cBlank Cards\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0By writing a unique combination of magic spells on a blank card, you can create your own unique \u201cExclusive Deck\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Don't want a certain card to appear in the game ......? Replace it with your own!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Write your own destiny and freely choose the nodes on the map you will encounter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b1fb8545cd82f893f4a2802f0d60d012.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Witches can't reverse time, but they can manipulate karma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Draw a certain number of fate cards from the map screen and arrange them on the timeline as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Once you have decided on a route, the next move will be as you envisioned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make rational resource deployment and develop targeted strategies based on the characteristics of your enemies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/9640541ad97fee3bf8b99c8d1b032ef9.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0In the game, you can obtain a variety of resources to strengthen your witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Construct your basic deck with cards, build your genre with relics, and strengthen your attributes with blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You will encounter enemies with different special abilities, to restrain or be restrained, depending on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alchemical synthesis, card enchantment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/3a9230da11d17ba2cd4ef5a03662fc1e.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Purchase materials from the Witch's House with the Crystal of Truth obtained from your adventures, and put them into the Alchemy Table to create new products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The finished product can be enchanted to temporarily change the effect of a card for one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Craft a 0-cost overcard, or focus all your damage on one card to create a \u201cmagic bomb\u201d, where resources are power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witch's Quest ...... and my choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The extermination of the world is the vocation of a witch, but it may not be the path I choose for myself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Witches with different experiences and personalities converge on Aldrin, guiding them to fulfill their mission, or liberate their nature? In any case, the choice is now in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witch's Apocalyptic Journey is a cooperative multiplayer card Roguelite game with role-playing elements. Form a Witch Squad with your buddies and come destroy the world to the ground~!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.poster.avif?t=1754287304\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.webm?t=1754287304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.mp4?t=1754287304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0As symbols of the ominous, the Witches are veritable stars of calamity, and in Aldrin, their presence means only one thing: the world is coming to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0 They are both executioners and morticians, leading the footsteps of the Witches as they give the world its last ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join your friends in the guise of a witch, or recruit a squad of NPCs!</h2><p class=\"bb_para