.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0By writing a unique combination of magic spells on a blank card, you can create your own unique \u201cExclusive Deck\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Don't want a certain card to appear in the game ......? Replace it with your own!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Write your own destiny and freely choose the nodes on the map you will encounter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b1fb8545cd82f893f4a2802f0d60d012.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Witches can't reverse time, but they can manipulate karma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Draw a certain number of fate cards from the map screen and arrange them on the timeline as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Once you have decided on a route, the next move will be as you envisioned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make rational resource deployment and develop targeted strategies based on the characteristics of your enemies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/9640541ad97fee3bf8b99c8d1b032ef9.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0In the game, you can obtain a variety of resources to strengthen your witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Construct your basic deck with cards, build your genre with relics, and strengthen your attributes with blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You will encounter enemies with different special abilities, to restrain or be restrained, depending on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alchemical synthesis, card enchantment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/3a9230da11d17ba2cd4ef5a03662fc1e.avif?t=1754287304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Purchase materials from the Witch's House with the Crystal of Truth obtained from your adventures, and put them into the Alchemy Table to create new products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The finished product can be enchanted to temporarily change the effect of a card for one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Craft a 0-cost overcard, or focus all your damage on one card to create a \u201cmagic bomb\u201d, where resources are power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/792881b4d28b471c9b3ae12cc95a1ad2.avif?t=1754287304\" width=595 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witch's Quest ...... and my choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The extermination of the world is the vocation of a witch, but it may not be the path I choose for myself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1754287304\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Witches with different experiences and personalities converge on Aldrin, guiding them to fulfill their mission, or liberate their nature? In any case, the choice is now in your hands.</p>",
    "short_description": "As the Abyss decays, the Witches of the End descend upon Aldrin. You, as the master of the witches, will guide their way, and will encounter the survivalist resistance of the world's will. Will you play an elegy for the world, or will you find the root of the decay and create hope out of despair...?",
